# Runtime database. Holds real password hashes, salts and live session tokens
# for every registered account — never commit it, even to a private repo.
/.data

# Downloaded API caches: Scryfall pools/prints, MTGJSON collation slices, and
# TCGplayer sealed prices and pack photos. ~68 MB, rebuilds itself on demand,
# and goes stale — regenerated data, not source.
/.cache

